The you struct is defined in include/you.h; the u instance of it is
declared in decl.c, and initialised in u_init() in u_init.c. However,
you don't need to care about that; all you need to worry about is that
(x == u.ux && y == u.uy) is true in mapglyph() iff the hero's location
is being mapped.

